OL,3,GNEWSAGrand Theatre set for #8.5m
OL,4,Arenovation
OL,5,
OL,6,FWolverhampton's Grand Theatre is set to
OL,7,Fundergo repair and maintenance work
OL,8,Fworth around #8.5m, the city council
OL,9,Fhas said.
OL,11,FAn emergency decision was made by City
OL,12,Fof Wolverhampton Council to appoint AHR
OL,13,FArchitects Ltd as the contractors for
OL,14,Fthe work on the 132-year-old building,
OL,15,Fafter surveys revealed defects.
OL,17,FThe building is owned by the local
OL,18,Fauthority but run on a 99-year lease by
OL,19,Fthe theatre's board.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
