OL,3,GNEWSAGrand Theatre set for #8.5m
OL,4,Arenovation
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil leader Stephen Simkins said he
OL,7,Falso believed the theatre should be
OL,8,Fclassified as a heritage site, calling
OL,9,Fit "a real piece of history of
OL,10,FWolverhampton".
